{
  "description": "Implement the xschema landing page per LANDING_CONTENT.md. Replace all Fumadocs placeholder sections with xschema-specific content. The hero and CliAnimation are already done. All text content comes from web/LANDING_CONTENT.md — do not invent copy. The visual style should match the existing earthy/warm theme (brand amber/yellow, olive accents, cream/dark backgrounds). Use existing cva variants (cardVariants, headingVariants, buttonVariants) defined in the landing page and extend them as needed. All new section components should be extracted into separate files under src/components/landing/. Reuse and adapt existing block/ui components (comparison-table, cpu-architecture, database-with-rest-api, google-gemini-effect, features-8, feature-cards) by renaming, restructuring, and repurposing them for their target landing sections — do not delete them. Make them data-driven so content (text, icons, items) can be easily swapped via props or arrays. The final page must pass `bun run build` and `bun run types:check` from the web/ directory.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "cleanup-fumadocs-sections",
      "category": "cleanup",
      "description": "Remove all Fumadocs placeholder sections and unused components from the landing page index.tsx",
      "steps": [
        "Open the landing page at web/src/routes/_layout/index.tsx",
        "Verify the Feedback function (testimonial marquee with shadcn/Anthony Shew/Aiden Bai/David Blass) is removed",
        "Verify the Aesthetics function (PreviewImages + Fumadocs customization text) is removed",
        "Verify the ForEngineers function (Framework Agnostic, composable framework, content adoption, search, shadcn/ui cards) is removed",
        "Verify the OpenSource function (Fumadocs-branded 'A Framework of Dream' section) is removed",
        "Verify the Search function is removed",
        "Verify the feedback array is removed",
        "Verify the searchItemVariants cva is removed",
        "Verify the commented-out AnybodyCanWrite section and CodeBlock references are removed",
        "Verify the Page component no longer renders <Feedback />, <Aesthetics />, <ForEngineers />, or <OpenSource />",
        "Verify unused imports are removed from index.tsx (Heart, SearchIcon, FileIcon, FileTextIcon, BatteryChargingIcon, TimerIcon, Marquee, PreviewImages, Writing, AgnosticBackground, ContentAdoptionBackground, ShadcnImage)",
        "Run bun run build from web/ directory and verify it succeeds",
        "Run bun run types:check from web/ directory and verify it succeeds"
      ],
      "passes": true,
      "notes": "This is the first step — create a clean slate. After this, the landing page should only have: Hero, description paragraph, 'One pipeline to rule them all' heading, and CliAnimation. Only index.tsx is modified here — do not touch other component files yet."
    },
    {
