        "Verify web/src/components/landing/page.client.tsx has Writing function removed",
        "Verify related imports are removed: MainImg, OpenAPIImg, NotebookImg, HeroImage, previewButtonVariants, WritingTabs, ArrowRight, Fragment (if no longer used), cva (if no longer used)",
        "Verify Hero, CliAnimation, AgnosticBackground, ContentAdoptionBackground, useIsVisible, NotificationWindow are kept",
        "Verify web/src/components/landing/main.png is deleted",
        "Verify web/src/components/landing/notebook.png is deleted",
        "Verify web/src/components/landing/openapi.png is deleted",
        "Verify web/src/components/landing/shadcn.png is deleted",
        "Verify web/src/components/landing/hero-preview.jpeg is deleted",
        "Verify web/src/components/landing/icons.tsx is cleaned: remove NextSVG, VercelLogo, NetlifyLogo. Keep OpenAPIIcon only if referenced elsewhere in the codebase, otherwise delete the entire file",
        "Verify no broken imports exist after cleanup",
        "Run bun run build from web/ and verify success",
        "Run bun run types:check from web/ and verify success"
      ],
      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Only cleaning dead code and unused assets. The marquee.tsx component should be kept. AgnosticBackground and ContentAdoptionBackground use WebGL shaders and should be kept for potential future use."
    },
    {
      "id": "refactor-comparison-table",
      "category": "refactor",
      "description": "Refactor comparison-table.tsx from a generic pricing table into a reusable 2-column comparison grid component, renamed and data-driven",
      "steps": [
        "Verify web/src/components/ui/comparison-table.tsx is renamed to web/src/components/ui/comparison-grid.tsx (or similar)",
        "Verify the component is rewritten from the 3-tier pricing layout into a 2-column comparison grid",
        "Verify the component accepts props or a data array defining: rows (label + value per column), column headers, and optional icons per row/cell (check/cross)",
        "Verify the component uses named exports (not the current 'Pricing' alias)",
        "Verify the component imports cn from @/lib/cn instead of @/lib/utils",
        "Verify the component uses the xschema theme (cardVariants or fd-card/fd-border colors) instead of generic Tailwind classes",
        "Verify the first column (xschema) is visually highlighted with branded color/background",
        "Verify the second column (one-off converters) is visually muted",
        "Verify no hardcoded content remains — all text is passed via props or data arrays",
        "Verify the grid is responsive: readable on mobile (stacked or horizontally scrollable)",
        "Run bun run build from web/ and verify success",
        "Run bun run types:check from web/ and verify success"
      ],
      "passes": true,
      "notes": "This component will be used in Section 2b. The current comparison-table.tsx is a 3-column pricing table with SSO/AI/Members rows — completely rewrite the structure but keep it in the same location (ui/ directory). Make the data shape something like: { label: string, values: [string, string], icons?: [ReactNode, ReactNode] }[]."
    },
    {
