        "Verify google-gemini-effect's hardcoded Aceternity branding (button text 'ui.aceternity.com', default title 'Build with Aceternity UI') is removed, replaced with configurable props",
        "Verify all three use named exports (no default exports), matching the codebase convention",
        "Verify SVG id attributes use unique prefixes or accept a prefix prop to avoid DOM collisions when multiple instances render",
        "Verify the database-with-rest-api component's badge/button/circle texts and light colors remain configurable via props (already partially done — ensure consistency)",
        "Verify all imports referencing old filenames are updated throughout the codebase",
        "Run bun run build from web/ and verify success",
        "Run bun run types:check from web/ and verify success"
