      "passes": true,
      "notes": "These three components are references/building blocks for the pipeline animation (Section 4a). The database-with-rest-api is the primary style reference — its SVG path animation with light-traveling-along-paths effect should be preserved and made more configurable. The cpu-architecture and google-gemini-effect may be used as-is, combined, or adapted — the implementer can choose the best approach in the pipeline animation item."
    },
    {
