        "Verify the component accepts a data array prop defining: title, description, icon (ReactNode), and optional detail (string) per card",
        "Verify the component supports configurable grid columns (e.g., 2x2 or 4-col via prop or responsive defaults)",
        "Verify all hardcoded placeholder content is removed — no 'Built for developers', 'Pricing like no other', etc.",
        "Verify the component uses the xschema theme: cardVariants or fd-card styling, brand colors for hover effects (not neutral-100/neutral-800)",
