        "Verify the component imports cn from @/lib/cn",
        "Verify the component uses named exports",
        "Verify web/src/components/blocks/grid-feature-cards.tsx is deleted (6-col SVG grid — not mapped to any section, purely generic demo content)",
        "Run bun run build from web/ and verify success",
        "Run bun run types:check from web/ and verify success"
      ],
      "passes": true,
      "notes": "This component will be used in Section 4b (component cards: CLI, Adapters, Client, Config). The features-8.tsx has a nice hover effect (gradient overlay + expanding left border + text slide) worth preserving. The feature-cards.tsx is a simpler Aceternity variant. Pick the better base and make it data-driven. grid-feature-cards.tsx is the only truly dead component — it has no mapping to any landing section and uses hardcoded SVG charts."
    },
    {
